{"id": "68798", "title": "怀念不如相见", "author": "叶夭夭", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68798.htm", "intro": "她等待五年，结果却仍是无限忧伤。 \r\n\r\n他闯入她的生活，一寸寸攻占她的心房，每一次心伤，每一份委屈， \r\n\r\n她落下的每一滴泪，都在他的心里细细收藏。原来，等待的并不一定是最美的。 \r\n\r\n她沉静地活在世间，就像隐于闹室的静白雪莲，只是他的爱将她拉于现实。 \r\n\r\n待前尘往事被揭开，家族家的纠葛摆在眼前，她该选择继续还是放弃？ \r\n\r\n一对双生姐妹花的故事。 \r\n\r\n纨绔和风光背后，她有了新的名字和新的生活，他们在同一座城，却有不同的故事。 \r\n\r\n如果遇见，请不要轻易放开她（他）的手。 \r\n\r\n相关阅读：高干 办公室恋情 日久生情 双胞胎", "base": "files/article/html/68/68798", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10546171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10546172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10546173.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10546174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10546175.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10546176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10546177.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10546178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10546179.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10546180.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "10546181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "10546182.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "10546183.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "10546184.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "10546185.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "10546186.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17", "file": "10546187.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18", "file": "10546188.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19", "file": "10546189.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20", "file": "10546190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21", "file": "10546191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22", "file": "10546192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23", "file": "10546193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24", "file": "10546194.ht